# say ... in color, ask secretly (D100). With output redirected the color is
# not part of the text; with input redirected, ask secretly reads like ask.
say "Error!" in color "red"
say "Fine" "and" 3 in color " DarkGreen "
shade is "cyan"
say "From a variable" in color shade
say in color "blue"
ask secretly "Password:" and call it password
say "length" length of password
ask secretly "PIN:" and call it pin
say pin plus 1
try
    say "x" in color "purple"
otherwise into reason
    say reason
.
try
    say "x" in color 5
otherwise into reason
    say reason
.
try
    say in color 5
otherwise into reason
    say reason
.
